    },
    {
      "lyric": "  On a dark desert highway,  cool wind in my hair.",
      "chords": [
        {
          "chord": "Bm",
          "col": 0
        },
        {
          "chord": "F#",
          "col": 27
        }
      ],
      "section": false,
      "t": null
    },
    {
      "lyric": " Warm smell of colitas, rising up through the air.",
      "chords": [
        {
          "chord": "A",
          "col": 0
        },
        {
          "chord": "E",
          "col": 23
        }
      ],
      "section": false,
      "t": null
    },
    {
      "lyric": " Up ahead in the distance, I saw a shimmering light.",
      "chords": [
        {
          "chord": "G",
          "col": 0
        },
        {
          "chord": "D",
          "col": 26
        }
      ],
      "section": false,
      "t": null
    },
    {
      "lyric": "  My head grew heavy and my sight grew dim,",
      "chords": [
        {
          "chord": "Em",
          "col": 0
        }
      ],
      "section": false,
      "t": null
    },
    {
      "lyric": "   I had to stop for the night.",
      "chords": [
        {
          "chord": "F#7",
          "col": 0
        }
      ],
      "section": false,
      "t": null
    },
    {
      "lyric": "  There she stood in the doorway;  I heard the mission bell,",
      "chords": [
        {
          "chord": "Bm",
          "col": 0
        },
        {
          "chord": "F#",
          "col": 33
        }
      ],
      "section": false,
      "t": null
    },
    {
      "lyric": " And I was thinking to myself, \"this could be heaven or this could be hell\".",
      "chords": [
        {
          "chord": "A",
          "col": 0
        },
        {
          "chord": "E",
          "col": 46
        }
      ],
      "section": false,
      "t": null
    },
    {
      "lyric": " Then she lit up a candle and she showed me the way.",
      "chords": [
        {
          "chord": "G",
          "col": 0
        },
        {
          "chord": "D",
          "col": 25
        }
      ],
      "section": false,
      "t": null
    },
    {
      "lyric": "  There were voices down the corridor,   I thought I heard them say...",
      "chords": [
        {
          "chord": "Em",
          "col": 0
        },
        {
          "chord": "F#7",
          "col": 38
        }
      ],
      "section": false,
      "t": null
    },
    {
      "lyric": " Welcome to the Hotel California, such a lovely place, such a lovely face.",
      "chords": [
        {
          "chord": "G",
          "col": 0
        },
        {
          "chord": "D",
          "col": 29
        },
        {
          "chord": "F#7",
          "col": 41
        },
        {
          "chord": "Bm",
          "col": 62
        }
      ],
      "section": false,
      "t": null
    },
    {
      "lyric": "Plenty of room at the Hotel California, any time of year, you can find it here.",
      "chords": [
        {
          "chord": "G",
          "col": 0
        },
        {
          "chord": "D",
          "col": 35
        },
        {
          "chord": "Em",
          "col": 44
        },
        {
          "chord": "F#7",
          "col": 66
        }
      ],
      "section": false,
      "t": null
    },
    {
      "lyric": "  Her mind is Tiffanytwisted,  she got the Mercedes Benz.",
      "chords": [
        {
          "chord": "Bm",
          "col": 0
        },
        {
          "chord": "F#",
          "col": 29
        }
      ],
      "section": false,
      "t": null
    },
    {
      "lyric": " She got a lot of pretty, pretty boys, that she calls friends.",
      "chords": [
        {
          "chord": "A",
          "col": 0
        },
        {
          "chord": "E",
          "col": 38
        }
      ],
      "section": false,
      "t": null
    },
    {
      "lyric": " How they dance in the courtyard, sweet summer sweat.",
      "chords": [
        {
          "chord": "G",
          "col": 0
        },
        {
          "chord": "D",
          "col": 34
        }
      ],
      "section": false,
      "t": null
    },
    {
      "lyric": "  Some dance to remember,   some dance to forget.",
      "chords": [
        {
          "chord": "Em",
          "col": 0
        },
        {
          "chord": "F#7",
          "col": 25
        }
      ],
      "section": false,
      "t": null
    },
    {
      "lyric": "  So I called up the Captain,  \"please bring me my wine\".",
      "chords": [
        {
          "chord": "Bm",
          "col": 0
        },
        {
          "chord": "F#",
          "col": 29
        }
      ],
      "section": false,
      "t": null
    },
    {
      "lyric": "He said \"we haven't had that spirit here since nineteen sixty nine\".",
      "chords": [
        {
          "chord": "A",
          "col": 7
        },
        {
          "chord": "E",
          "col": 46
        }
      ],
      "section": false,
      "t": null
    },
    {
      "lyric": " And still those voices are calling from far away.",
      "chords": [
        {
          "chord": "G",
          "col": 0
        },
        {
          "chord": "D",
          "col": 41
        }
      ],
      "section": false,
      "t": null
    },
    {
      "lyric": "  Wake you up in the middle of the night   just to hear them say...",
      "chords": [
        {
          "chord": "Em",
          "col": 0
        },
        {
          "chord": "F#7",
          "col": 40
        }
      ],
      "section": false,
      "t": null
    },
    {
      "lyric": " Welcome to the Hotel California, such a lovely place, such a lovely face.",
      "chords": [
        {
          "chord": "G",
          "col": 0
        },
        {
          "chord": "D",
          "col": 29
        },
        {
          "chord": "F#7",
          "col": 41
        },
        {
          "chord": "Bm",
          "col": 62
        }
      ],
      "section": false,
      "t": null
    },
    {
      "lyric": "They living it up at the Hotel California. What a nice surprise, bring your ali",
      "chords": [
        {
          "chord": "G",
          "col": 5
        },
        {
          "chord": "D",
          "col": 38
        },
        {
          "chord": "Em",
          "col": 50
        },
        {
          "chord": "F#7",
          "col": 76
        }
      ],
      "section": false,
      "t": null
    },
    {
      "lyric": "bis.",
      "chords": [],
      "section": false,
      "t": null
    },
    {
      "lyric": "  Mirrors on the ceiling,  the pink champagne on ice.",
      "chords": [
        {
          "chord": "Bm",
          "col": 0
        },
        {
          "chord": "F#",
          "col": 25
        }
      ],
      "section": false,
      "t": null
    },
    {
      "lyric": "And she said \"we are all just prisoners here, of our own device\".",
      "chords": [
        {
          "chord": "A",
          "col": 12
        },
        {
          "chord": "E",
          "col": 45
        }
      ],
      "section": false,
      "t": null
    },
    {
      "lyric": " And in the master's chambers, they've gathered for the feast.",
      "chords": [
        {
          "chord": "G",
          "col": 0
        },
        {
          "chord": "D",
          "col": 30
        }
      ],
      "section": false,
      "t": null
    },
    {
      "lyric": "  They stab it with their steely knives, but they just can't kill the beast.",
      "chords": [
        {
          "chord": "Em",
          "col": 0
        },
        {
          "chord": "F#7",
          "col": 50
        }
      ],
      "section": false,
      "t": null
    },
    {
      "lyric": "  Last thing I remember, I was  running for the door.",
      "chords": [
        {
          "chord": "Bm",
          "col": 0
        },
        {
          "chord": "F#",
          "col": 30
        }
      ],
      "section": false,
      "t": null
    },
    {
      "lyric": " I had to find the passage back to the place I was before.",
      "chords": [
        {
          "chord": "A",
          "col": 0
        },
        {
          "chord": "E",
          "col": 39
        }
      ],
      "section": false,
      "t": null
    },
    {
      "lyric": " \"Relax\" said the night man, we are programmed to receive.",
      "chords": [
        {
          "chord": "G",
          "col": 0
        },
        {
          "chord": "D",
          "col": 35
        }
      ],
      "section": false,
      "t": null
    },
    {
      "lyric": "  You can check out any time you like,   but you can never leave.",
      "chords": [
        {
          "chord": "Em",
          "col": 0
        },
        {
